SUMMARY:Upstairs at Helium: Ahamed Weinberg
LOCATION:Helium Comedy Club\, 10 W. Georgia St.\, Portland
DESCRIPTION:Ahamed Weinberg is a New York-based comedian and film-maker fro
 m Philadelphia. He made his late night stand up debut on Late Night w/ Seth
  Meyers (NBC)\, and has also appeared on The Late Show w/ Stephen Colbert (
 CBS).\n\nAhamed has recently released his first Half Hour special with Don'
 t Tell Comedy. He is a regular at The Comedy Cellar in New York City and Th
 e Comedy Store in Los Angeles.\n\nOther credits include writing\, directing
 \, and starring in two seasons of Ahamed’s Ramadan Diaries (Comedy Centra
 l Digital)\, and appearing in Comedy Bang Bang (IFC)\, The Eric Andre Show 
 (Adult Swim)\, I Love You\, America (Hulu)\, Comedy Knockout (Tru TV)\, Lat
 e Bloomer (Crave)\, Insecure (HBO) and Hacks (HBO). His film Lovebirds prem
 iered on Amazon Prime as part of their inaugural FunnyFest short films fest
 ival\, and his Facebook series Please Understand Me was executive produced 
 by Sarah Silverman and released in June 2018\, amassing millions of views.\
